| **Cleanup Boilerplate** | **CRITICAL** | 9 identical cleanup sequences in `main.c` (lines 46-154) |
| **String Allocation Pattern** | **HIGH** | 8 instances of `malloc + strcpy` repeated (parser.c lines 79-786) |
