| **AstGen allocation fails** | `cir_module_free(ir), node_free(program), parser_free(parser), lexer_free(lexer), free(source)` | 2x (lines 94-98, 109-113) |
| **File write fails** | All 5 resources freed identically | 2x (lines 121-126, 134-139) |
| **Success path** | All 5 resources freed identically | 1x (lines 149-154) |

**Code Duplication Analysis**:
```
Cleanup Chain Frequency:
  free(source)                                     → 5 occurrences
  lexer_free(lexer); free(source)                 → 2 occurrences
  parser_free(p); lexer_free(l); free(s)         → 2 occurrences
  node_free(prog); parser_free(p); ...           → 2 occurrences
